# Force Unix line endings (LF) for files that run inside Linux containers.
# Why: on Windows, Git/editors can save files with CRLF. A shell script with CRLF
# fails inside Docker with errors like "bash\r: No such file or directory".
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
